{"id":"meren","name":"Meren","type":"character","aliases":["Meren Deathbender"],"description":"A young Nel Toth shaman apprentice who discovers a power of death in her trial, is condemned by her clan, and returns years later as a necromancer to destroy it.","pages":1,"first_seen":"2015-11-04","last_seen":"2015-11-04","description_citations":[{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"All the Cairns of Jund","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Michael Yichao"],"date":"2015-11-04","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/all-cairns-jund-2015-11-04","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/all-cairns-jund-2015-11-04","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"All the Cairns of Jund\" by Michael Yichao. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 4 Nov 2015."}],"bio":null,"timeline":[{"id":"all-cairns-jund-2015-11-04-e0","era":null,"summary":"Meren, an apprentice shaman, is anointed by the Circle of Nel Toth with the Dreamfire Draught for her trial to become a full shaman.","participants":["meren","elder-shaman","kael","circle-of-nel-toth","dreamfire-draught"],"location":"jund","importance":"major","page":"stories/all-cairns-jund-2015-11-04","order":484,"story_date":"2015-11-04","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":9,"quote":"We of the Circle of Nel Toth anoint you, Meren, child of stone and blood and bone, with the Dreamfire Draught.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/all-cairns-jund-2015-11-04#:~:text=We%20of%20the%20Circle,with%20the%20Dreamfire%20Draught.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"All the Cairns of Jund","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Michael Yichao"],"date":"2015-11-04","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/all-cairns-jund-2015-11-04","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/all-cairns-jund-2015-11-04#:~:text=We%20of%20the%20Circle,with%20the%20Dreamfire%20Draught.","archived":null,"license":n