2015-11-04","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/all-cairns-jund-2015-11-04","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/all-cairns-jund-2015-11-04#:~:text=You%20are%20Skaal%20Kesh,and%20bound%20to%20me.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"All the Cairns of Jund\" by Michael Yichao. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 4 Nov 2015."}},{"id":"all-cairns-jund-2015-11-04-e3","era":null,"summary":"In the trial, a massive elemental forms from the earth and the Circle chants as Meren must bind it while poison racks her body.","participants":["meren","circle-of-nel-toth","elder-shaman"],"location":"jund","importance":"minor","page":"stories/all-cairns-jund-2015-11-04","order":484,"story_date":"2015-11-04","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":36,"quote":"Before her, coalescing from the earth, a massive elemental reared up.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/all-cairns-jund-2015-11-04#:~:text=Before%20her%2C%20coalescing%20from,massive%20elemental%20reared%20up.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"All the Cairns of Jund","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Michael Yichao"],"date":"2015-11-04","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/all-cairns-jund-2015-11-04","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/all-cairns-jund-2015-11-04#:~:text=Before%20her%2C%20coalescing%20from,massive%20elemental%20reared%20up.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"All the Cairns of Jund\" by Michael Yichao. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 4 Nov 2015."}},{"id":"all-cairns-jund-2015-11-04-e4","era":null,"summary":"Meren ambushes a Nel Toth hunting party, killing two warriors and the shaman and raising them as the Borrowed.","participants":["meren","borrowed-ones","circle-of-nel-toth"],"location":"jund","importance":"major","page":"stories/all-cairns-jund-2015-11-04","order":484,"story_date":"2015-11-04","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":57,"quote":"The shaman rose from the ground and stood haltingly.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/all-cairns-jund-2015-11-04#:~:text=The%20shaman%20rose%20from,ground%20and%20stood%20haltingly.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"All the Cairns of Jund","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Michael Yichao"],"date":"2015-11-04","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/all-cairns-jund-2015-11-04","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/all-cairns-jund-2015-11-04#:~:text=The%20shaman%20rose%20from,ground%20and%20stood%20haltingly.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"All the Cairns of Jund\" by Michael Yichao. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 4 Nov 2015."}},{"id":"all-cairns-jund-2015-11-04-e5","era":null,"summary":"Meren forces the dead shaman to point the way to the clan's new convening caves and sets her Borrowed party marching.","participants":["meren","borrowed-ones"],"location":"jund","importance":"minor","page":"stories/all-cairns-jund-2015-11-04","order":484,"story_date":"2015-11-04","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":58,"quote":"Where are the new convening caves of the Circle.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/all-cairns-jund-2015-11-04#:~:text=Where%20are%20the%20new,caves%20of%20the%20Circle.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"All the Cairns of Jund","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Michael Yichao"],"date":"2015-11-04","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/all-cairns-jund-2015-11-04","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/all-cairns-jund-2015-11-04#:~:text=Where%20are%20the%20new,caves%20of%20the%20Circle.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"All the Cairns of Jund\" by Michael Yichao. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 4 Nov 2015."}},{"id":"all-cairns-jund-2015-11-04-e6","era":null,"summary":"Flashback: the elemental recoils from Meren's 