Magic Story","authors":["Michael Yichao"],"date":"2015-11-04","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/all-cairns-jund-2015-11-04","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/all-cairns-jund-2015-11-04#:~:text=We%20must%20kill%20her%20now.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"All the Cairns of Jund\" by Michael Yichao. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 4 Nov 2015."}},{"id":"all-cairns-jund-2015-11-04-e10","era":null,"summary":"Flashback: the elder shaman stops the killing, ruling the trial continues until the draught is purged or she dies, and the Circle leaves her to die.","participants":["elder-shaman","kael","meren","circle-of-nel-toth"],"location":"jund","importance":"major","page":"stories/all-cairns-jund-2015-11-04","order":484,"story_date":"2015-11-04","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":135,"quote":"Let her conclude the trial alone.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/all-cairns-jund-2015-11-04#:~:text=Let%20her%20conclude%20the%20trial%20alone.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"All the Cairns of Jund","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Michael Yichao"],"date":"2015-11-04","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/all-cairns-jund-2015-11-04","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/all-cairns-jund-2015-11-04#:~:text=Let%20her%20conclude%20the%20trial%20alone.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"All the Cairns of Jund\" by Michael Yichao. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 4 Nov 2015."}},{"id":"all-cairns-jund-2015-11-04-e11","era":null,"summary":"Flashback: Kael tells Meren to die quietly and alone, and abandons her.","participants":["kael","meren"],"location":"jund","importance":"major","page":"stories/all-cairns-jund-2015-11-04","order":484,"story_date":"2015-11-04","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":140,"quote":"Die, Meren. Die quiet and alone.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/all-